{"articleNo":"40048","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=40048&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[무료강좌 재개설]Six Sigma 개선리더(GB) 입문과정","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2012.02.15","hit":"6379","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Six Sigma 교육을 요청하는 학생이 많은 관계로 한 과정 더 개설할 예정이오니</p><p>학생 여러분들의 많은 참여 부탁드립니다.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;<span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">취업 경쟁력 강화를 위한</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 21.6pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">Six Sigma 개선리더(GB) 입문과정</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 11pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">교육 일정 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">: 2012년 2월 22일(수)~2월 27일(월)(4일간 32H)</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 11pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">교육 시간 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">: 09:00~18:00(1일 8H)</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">교육 대상 : 우리대학 재학생 30명</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">강&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 사 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">: 이도경, 이욱기(금오공대 교수님)</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"></span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">특&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 징 : </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">전문 Module별 철저한 맞춤식 교육 실시</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 11pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 인적자원개발센터 명의의 수료증 발급(출석률80%이상)</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 11pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 11pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><!--StartFragment--></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">신청안내</span></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">○접수방법 :&nbsp;방문접수 (선착순)-그린에너지관 313호</span></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">○접수기간 : 2월 15일~</span></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">○학 습 비 : 무료, 교재 제공</span></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">○장&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 소 : 금오공과대학교 전산강의실</span></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">○문의전화 : 054-478-7241,7928 </span></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 11pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 11pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\">&nbsp;</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
